diff -Nru mesa-25.3.3/subprojects/libc-0.2.169/debian/patches/time64-108-fix-stat-i386.patch mesa-25.3.3/subprojects/libc-0.2.169/debian/patches/time64-108-fix-stat-i386.patch
--- mesa-25.3.3/subprojects/libc-0.2.169/debian/patches/time64-108-fix-stat-i386.patch	1969-12-31 19:00:00.000000000 -0500
+++ mesa-25.3.3/subprojects/libc-0.2.169/debian/patches/time64-108-fix-stat-i386.patch	2024-12-28 15:35:00.000000000 -0500
@@ -0,0 +1,92 @@
+The patch series taken from upstream unconditionally changes the stat definitions
+in src/unix/linux_like/linux/gnu/b32/x86/mod.rs, since we don't enable time64
+on i386 this causes us problems. This patch puts back the old definitions and
+adds conditionals.
+
