--- mesa-25.3.3/subprojects/libc-0.2.169/src/unix/linux_like/linux/musl/b32/arm/mod.rs	1969-12-31 19:00:00.000000000 -0500
+++ mesa-25.3.3/subprojects/libc-0.2.169/src/unix/linux_like/linux/musl/b32/arm/mod.rs	2006-07-23 20:21:28.000000000 -0500
